{"availability":"available","full":"jojin1709/Clipwise","name":"Clipwise","description":"Local-first AI product demo generator. Explores websites with Playwright, discovers features, plans scenes with local Ollama LLMs, and records & renders studio-quality MP4 showcase videos using FFmpeg.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"JavaScript","stars":0,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-26T16:36:10Z","updated":"2026-09-26T19:00:49Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://jojin1709.github.io/Clipwise/","topics":["ai-video-generator","browser-automation","desktop-app","ffmpeg","local-first","ollama","playwright","product-demo","react","rust","tauri","typescript"],"demo":"https://jojin1709.github.io/Clipwise/","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:40.826Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:40.826Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:40.826Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-11T22:39:40.826Z","stars":0,"forks":0}],"technologies":["React","Rust"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A real, native Windows desktop application built with Tauri 2, Rust, React, and Playwright — Clipwise crawls your web application, discovers key features and interactive workflows, plans cinematic demo scenes using local Ollama LLMs or deterministic heuristic fallbacks, records browser interactions with natural human Bezier mouse movements, and renders studio-quality MP4 demo videos using FFmpeg.","100% Local-First · Zero Cloud API Subscriptions · Your Data Stays on Your Machine","[]( []( [](LICENSE) []( []( []( []( []( -0D1117?style=flat-square&labelColor=0D1117&logo=windows&logoColor=0078D4) []("],"features":["Automated Deep Crawl & Exploration — Headless/Headed Chromium via Playwright navigates target sites up to configurable depths, capturing screenshots, DOM states, navigation trees, and interactive tool buttons.","Intelligent Feature Discovery — Discovers search bars, dashboards, auth screens, CTAs, converters, navigation structures, and data displays with confidence ratings and semantic scoring.","AI Scene & Script Planning — Leverages your local Ollama instance (e.g. qwen2.5:3b, llama3.2, mistral) to structure a multi-scene showcase with timings and narration script. Includes a robust deterministic fallback…","Autonomous Interaction Recording — Simulates authentic human exploration with natural Bezier mouse trajectories, realistic text typing cadence, button click ripples, and an in-video lower-third status HUD.","Hardware-Accelerated Video Rendering — Compiles, transcode, and exports the final video to clean H.264 MP4 with FFmpeg, ready for your landing page, YouTube, X, or pitch deck."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jojin1709/Clipwise/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"67c3735fe6eab03bde91c8c1ced4a6053d020990bb54d8a4c19947939226c142","extractedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:41.002Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:41.002Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A real, native Windows desktop application built with Tauri 2, Rust, React, and Playwright — Clipwise crawls your web application, discovers key features and interactive workflows, plans cinematic demo scenes using local Ollama LLMs or deterministic heuristic fallbacks, records browser interactions with natural human Bezier mouse movements, and renders studio-quality MP4 demo videos using FFmpeg.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jojin1709/Clipwise/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"required","text":"Safe Authentication Handling: Clipwise detects login and authentication forms automatically and marks them with low recording priority — never submitting credentials or executing destructive actions.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jojin1709/Clipwise/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"67c3735fe6eab03bde91c8c1ced4a6053d020990bb54d8a4c19947939226c142","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/jojin1709/Clipwise/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-11T22:39:41.003Z"},"overviewRepoUp